  icon: {fileID: 0}
  itemDescription: "Future Mobility Technologies Institute  This institute focuses
    on innovative transportation technologies that will shape future mobility. Its
    mission includes research on autonomous vehicles, electric and alternative-fuel
    vehicles, drone delivery systems, hyperloop or high-speed rail concepts, and
    intelligent transport infrastructure. Key areas: developing sensors and AI for
    self-driving cars and drones, designing traffic systems for autonomous vehicle
    integration, improving electric vehicle (EV) technology (battery management,
    charging infrastructure), and exploring futuristic transit like flying taxis
    or hyperloop feasibility. The institute supports Saudi Arabia\u2019s efforts
    to modernize transport (e.g. NEOM\u2019s advanced transit systems) by providing
    R&D and technical guidance. The goal is a safer, more efficient, and sustainable
    transport network through cutting-edge tech"
